{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"这是一种一开始就已经在场、并不需要试探才出现的感受；它很快收敛了外露的强度，但内部的连续性没有因此中断。此处最值得保留的不是某个对象或愿望，而是“明确出现却随即收住，仍持续向前”的体验形态。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"首段，尚无已建立History可作为前因。\",\"bridge\":\"因此本段不能把这种状态追溯到虚构的旧事；这里只能先建立当前体验本身的心理形态，供后段在确有依据时回溯使用。\",\"current\":\"开头的明确进入与随后的收敛并存，而跨三小节的连续推进使这种收敛不像撤回或中断，更像感受仍在，只是不继续以同样强度外露。\",\"without\":\"没有前述History可删除比较；这是Thread的起点，本段不新增过去原因。\"},\"used\":[],\"new_history\":[\"H1：这次体验从一开始就已经明确在场；即使外露强度很快收敛，内在的持续并未中断。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"首段没有可调用的既往经历，因此没有伪造因果；只把当前音乐支持的心理形态建立为以后可能使用的具体History，也未据力度变化推断任何外部回应或关系事实。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dca29149-4e41-476c-9a2b-6880e1b29191", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214158321253Z", "elapsed_seconds": 12.234, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:42:10.551393+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "73341ac13d10f247bb22b28cf32b63e17bf1dda6e3db86280837e50ee1b848ba", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_w